        "original_id": "565a2026-04ca-5b50-839b-281f75d236de",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Channing Tatum\n- Characters: Duke\n- Companies: Hasbro\n- Products: G.I. Joe toyline, G.I. Joe Hall of Fame 12-inch action figures\n- Films: Coach Carter, G.I. Joe live-action films\n\nFacts:\n- In 1991, Hasbro began the G.I. Joe Hall of Fame era of 12-inch action figures by releasing the Target Exclusive Duke in response to demand from nostalgic collectors of vintage G.I. Joe figures.\n- In 2005, Channing Tatum made his film debut in the drama film Coach Carter.\n- Channing Matthew Tatum, born April 26, 1980, is an American actor.\n- Duke is a fictional character from the G.I. Joe toyline, comic books, and cartoon series.\n- Channing Tatum portrays Duke in the 2009 live-action film G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra and the 2013 sequel G.I. Joe: Retaliation.",
